        <mxCell id="note" value="⚠ In the offline demo, step 3→4 works only because demo.py manually flips the gateway double (gateway.activate_permits). No production code propagates activation to the enforcement point yet (C2)." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=10;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
